  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Virtual PCF pattern preserved. React 16 + Fluent 9 platform-libraries. No bundling regression.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Shared PolymorphicPicker consumption preserved. Do NOT modify the shared component.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Manual refresh button (SRFR-034) STAYS — auto-refresh is ADDITIVE, not a replacement.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-A5-02">CREATE mode (formType === 1) MUST skip auto-refresh — presave bridge (`__sprk_regarding_pending__`) owns that path. Refreshing during CREATE clobbers the buffered attributes and breaks the INSERT transaction.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Xrm-unavailable path: warn + silent-continue (no throw). Test harness safety — the harness has no Xrm, and rejection would surface as unhandled promise rejection breaking test infra.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Backward compat: existing selection flow unchanged EXCEPT for the new post-selection refresh. All existing tests pass with only version-string bumps.</constraint>
    <constraint source="src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md — Version Update Checklist">ALL 7 anchors bumped together (manifest, index.ts, footer BUILD_DATE, solution.xml, Solution ControlManifest, package.json, pack.ps1).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">TypeScript strict mode; use existing `getXrm()` helper for Xrm access.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>pcf/version-discipline + Xrm.Page.data lifecycle (save + refresh)</topic>
    <files>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolverApp.tsx</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="formType detection" location="RegardingResolverApp.tsx (existing getHostRecordId helper)">
        Xrm.Page.ui.getFormType() returns 1 (CREATE), 2 (UPDATE), 3 (READONLY), 4 (DISABLED), 6 (BULKEDIT). SRFR-032 already keys CREATE-mode branch on empty hostRecordId; we mirror that with an explicit formType check for clarity.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>
      SRFR-034 deployed v1.3.1 with a manual refresh button. Owner UAT
      feedback: manual click still required after picker selection to see
      the newly-populated record-number / etc. Owner wants auto-refresh
      after selection so the form updates transparently. This task lands
      as v1.3.2 to preserve v1.3.1 as the shipped baseline. Ships in
      parallel with SRFR-036 (sprk_todo form field config) — no collision.
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="SRFR-034" status="completed">v1.3.1 shipped with manual refresh button.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
    <related-work>
      <item>SRFR-036 (parallel) — sprk_todo main form field config (2/3 + 1/3 width + companion hyperlink webresource). Different files.</item>
    </related-work>
  </context>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Verify context &lt; 60%. Read current `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` `handlePickerSelect` seam. Confirm `getFormType` shape on Xrm.Page.ui.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add autoRefreshForm helper">In `RegardingResolverApp.tsx`, add a module-level `autoRefreshForm(formType: number)` async helper. CREATE-mode (formType === 1) early-return. Otherwise get Xrm, call `data.entity.save()` (await), then `data.refresh(true)` (await). Wrap in try/catch → warn only.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Wire autoRefreshForm after applyRegardingSelection">In `handlePickerSelect`, after the existing successful `applyRegardingSelection` block and after CREATE-mode seam publish + onRecordTypeChanged, call `autoRefreshForm(formType)`. formType obtained via `xrm?.Page?.ui?.getFormType?.() ?? 2` (default UPDATE). Do NOT await inside the try/catch that handles applyRegardingSelection — auto-refresh is best-effort.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Version bump — Location 1 (ControlManifest.Input.xml)">Update `version="1.3.2"` on the control root element.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Version bump — Location 2 (index.ts CONTROL_VERSION)">Update `CONTROL_VERSION = '1.3.2'`.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Version bump — Location 3 (BUILD_DATE)">Update `BUILD_DATE = '2026-07-03'` (unchanged if same day).</step>
    <step order="6" name="Version bump — Location 4 (Solution manifest)">Update `Solution/solution.xml` `&lt;Version&gt;` element to `1.3.2`.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Version bump — Location 5 (Solution Control Manifest)">Update `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.xml` version attribute to `1.3.2`.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Version bump — Location 6 (package.json)">Update `package.json` `"version": "1.3.2"`.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Version bump — Location 7 (pack.ps1)">Update `$version = "1.3.2"`.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Tests — bulk version + new coverage">
      In `__tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx`:
      (a) Bulk replace 1.3.1 → 1.3.2 (version prop and version regex).
      (b) Add test: UPDATE mode selection (formType 2) → save() then refresh(true) called.
      (c) Add test: CREATE mode selection (formType 1) → save/refresh NOT called (presave bridge owns).
      (d) Add test: Xrm unavailable → auto-refresh silent-continues (no throw, no crash).
    </step>
    <step order="11" name="Grep verification">Grep for `1.3.1` under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` (exclude node_modules + out + Solution/bin). Assert zero non-history hits.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="Quality Gate">Invoke `/code-review` and `/adr-check` on modified files: ControlManifest.Input.xml, index.ts, RegardingResolverApp.tsx, solution.xml, extracted ControlManifest.xml, package.json, pack.ps1, RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx. Address findings or escalate per CLAUDE.md §6.5.</step>
    <step order="12" name="Build">Run `npm run build:prod` in `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/`. Confirm build passes.</step>
    <step order="13" name="Test run">Run `npm test`. Confirm all tests pass (SRFR-034 51 + SRFR-035 3 new = 54 expected).</step>
    <step order="14" name="Copy bundle + pack solution">Copy `out/controls/RegardingResolver/bundle.js` to `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/bundle.js`. Run `Solution/pack.ps1` to produce `Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.2.zip`.</step>
    <step order="15" name="Deploy">Run `pac solution import --path Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.2.zip --force-overwrite --publish-changes` against spaarkedev1. Verify via `pac solution list | Select-String RegardingResolver` shows Version 1.3.2.</step>
    <step order="16" name="Update Task Status">Update SRFR-035 status → completed, notes summary. Update TASK-INDEX.md — add row for SRFR-035 under Wave 3 as another follow-on. Reset current-task.md.</step>
  </steps>

